a frequently asked question: Who is Elbereth?

Elbereth, aka Varda, is the Star-Queen (matron saint) of the elves
of Middle Earth.  "The Hand of Elbereth" is something of a
ceremonial title bequeathed to a devout individual ...

[following text from The Lord of The Rings, trilogy by J. R. R. Tolkien]

[near the beginning of the quest]
...  Desparate, he drew his own sword, and it seemed to him that it
